  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 202.19 “Prehearing conference” means a convening by the presiding officer pursuant to RSA 541-A:31, V. The term includes a status conference or a commission technical session.\n\nSource. #14184, eff 1-24-25",
